+if (EMSCRIPTEN)
+  # The normal runtime uses MEMFS and carries its image with it.  The
+  # interpreter runs on a pthread (PROXY_TO_PTHREAD) so the JS main thread
+  # stays free to start workers and deliver WebSocket events; blocking is
+  # legal on the worker, so Asyncify is not needed.
